1
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:08,346
Good morning, I'm Anders Fjell, and this is Nordic Crypto.

2
00:00:08,898 --> 00:00:13,939
This week: Skatteetaten says eighty-nine thousand six
hundred people reported cryptocurrency holdings of

3
00:00:13,939 --> 00:00:15,732
twenty-four point six billion kroner.

4
00:00:15,732 --> 00:00:19,953
Realtid reports a six-year prison sentence in a United
States SIM-swap case.

5
00:00:19,953 --> 00:00:24,154
And Lunar says it is selling its crypto customers and
closing Lunar Block.

6
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:31,712
According to preliminary figures from the Norwegian Tax
Administration, Skatteetaten, for the twenty twenty-five

7
00:00:31,712 --> 00:00:35,859
income year, eighty-nine thousand six hundred people
reported cryptocurrency holdings.

8
00:00:35,859 --> 00:00:39,609
The total reported value was twenty-four point six billion
kroner.

9
00:00:39,609 --> 00:00:42,437
Skatteetaten says checks are being tightened.

10
00:00:42,437 --> 00:00:48,234
From twenty twenty-six, businesses that offer exchange and
custody of cryptocurrency must report information to

11
00:00:48,234 --> 00:00:48,912
Skatteetaten.

12
00:00:49,466 --> 00:00:54,828
The European Securities and Markets Authority has published
a call for evidence on tokenising collateral posted to

13
00:00:54,828 --> 00:00:58,308
central counterparties, Finanstilsynet said on the
eighteenth of November.

14
00:00:58,308 --> 00:01:03,790
ESMA is inviting a public hearing on the seventh of January
twenty twenty-seven, in Paris and online.

15
00:01:03,790 --> 00:01:09,600
Registration closes on the sixteenth of December twenty
twenty-six, and written comments are due by the fifteenth of

16
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,003
January twenty twenty-seven.

17
00:01:11,003 --> 00:01:13,708
This is a consultation, not a new rule.

18
00:01:14,254 --> 00:01:21,052
NBX has filed an application for a banking licence in Latvia
for its wholly owned subsidiary, NBX Digital Asset Bank, in

19
00:01:21,052 --> 00:01:23,998
Riga, Kaupr reports, citing a stock exchange notice.

20
00:01:23,998 --> 00:01:27,410
The application is for a specialised credit institution.

21
00:01:27,410 --> 00:01:29,899
It has been filed, not granted.

22
00:01:29,899 --> 00:01:34,813
Latvijas Banka will ask for more information before the
application counts as complete, and the European Central

23
00:01:34,813 --> 00:01:37,840
Bank grants the licence on the Latvian central bank's
recommendation.

24
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:43,202
NBX says operations could start at the earliest by the end
of twenty twenty-seven, with twenty twenty-eight more

25
00:01:43,202 --> 00:01:43,537
likely.

26
00:01:44,082 --> 00:01:49,912
H100 Group has entered a partnership with Coinbase for
institutional custody, trading and financing of its bitcoin,

27
00:01:49,912 --> 00:01:54,727
through Coinbase Prime and Deribit, according to a company
notice on the sixteenth of November.

28
00:01:54,727 --> 00:01:57,197
Finansavisen reported the notice.

29
00:01:57,197 --> 00:02:01,111
The company says it holds about three thousand five hundred
and six bitcoin.

30
00:02:01,111 --> 00:02:06,483
On its own price of sixty-four thousand six hundred dollars
on the fifteenth of November, it valued those holdings at

31
00:02:06,483 --> 00:02:08,734
about two hundred and twenty-six million dollars.

32
00:02:08,734 --> 00:02:12,791
The notice describes a longer-term ambition to develop
investor services.

33
00:02:12,791 --> 00:02:16,346
It does not say that an asset-management product has been
launched.

34
00:02:18,510 --> 00:02:23,762
A twenty-four-year-old British man has been sentenced to six
years in prison in the United States after pleading guilty

35
00:02:23,762 --> 00:02:28,705
to conspiracy to commit wire fraud and aggravated identity
theft, as part of the group Scattered Spider, Realtid

36
00:02:28,705 --> 00:02:30,426
reported on the nineteenth of November.

37
00:02:30,426 --> 00:02:36,161
According to Realtid, the group used SMS phishing and SIM
swapping, and cryptocurrency worth about one hundred and

38
00:02:36,161 --> 00:02:38,223
twenty million Swedish kronor was stolen.

39
00:02:38,223 --> 00:02:43,811
The paper, referring to the US Department of Justice, says
at least twelve companies were affected, and that he is the

40
00:02:43,811 --> 00:02:45,610
fifth person sentenced in the US case.

41
00:02:45,610 --> 00:02:49,248
The official Justice Department text was not read for this
report.

42
00:02:49,802 --> 00:02:55,890
In its interim report for the first nine months of twenty
twenty-six, H100 Group says fully diluted bitcoin per share

43
00:02:55,890 --> 00:02:58,439
rose four point three six percent, Kaupr reports.

44
00:02:58,439 --> 00:03:03,701
Holdings went from about one thousand and fifty-one bitcoin
to about three thousand four hundred and seventy-seven,

45
00:03:03,701 --> 00:03:07,087
after an acquisition and a loss of about thirty bitcoin in
an active pool.

46
00:03:07,087 --> 00:03:12,580
Profit before tax was one hundred and forty-two point nine
million kronor, including a one-off gain of one hundred and

47
00:03:12,580 --> 00:03:14,536
seventy-one million from that acquisition.

48
00:03:14,536 --> 00:03:17,517
Without that gain the result would have been negative.

49
00:03:17,517 --> 00:03:20,888
The report has not been reviewed by the company's auditors.

50
00:03:20,888 --> 00:03:25,427
The board has called a meeting on the seventh of December to
seek authorisation for a share buyback.

51
00:03:25,427 --> 00:03:28,111
The company has not decided on a buyback.

52
00:03:28,654 --> 00:03:33,655
Swedish police were called to central Tenhult early on the
eighteenth of November after two people were robbed of

53
00:03:33,655 --> 00:03:37,240
cryptocurrency in their home, according to a police summary
for Jönköping County.

54
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:39,402
Omni reported the summary.

55
00:03:39,402 --> 00:03:45,136
The police say the perpetrators assaulted one victim and,
under threat, forced a transfer by computer, then bound the

56
00:03:45,136 --> 00:03:45,970
victims and left.

57
00:03:45,970 --> 00:03:48,162
Nobody has been arrested.

58
00:03:48,162 --> 00:03:51,677
The case is being investigated as aggravated robbery.

59
00:03:52,218 --> 00:03:57,639
Huddlestock Fintech has signed a letter of intent with the
crypto exchange Firi for a tied-agent solution, Kaupr

60
00:03:57,639 --> 00:03:59,575
reports, citing a stock-exchange notice.

61
00:03:59,575 --> 00:04:05,707
It is a letter of intent, not a completed agreement, and it
remains subject to further commercial, operational and

62
00:04:05,707 --> 00:04:06,890
regulatory assessment.

63
00:04:06,890 --> 00:04:10,999
As planned, Firi would become a tied agent under
Huddlestock's licence.

64
00:04:10,999 --> 00:04:16,635
The release describes Firi as the largest crypto exchange in
the Nordics, with about four hundred and thirty thousand

65
00:04:16,635 --> 00:04:17,454
retail customers.

66
00:04:18,014 --> 00:04:23,724
On the sixteenth of November, malicious JavaScript was
served through Optimizely Web Experimentation to visitors of

67
00:04:23,724 --> 00:04:28,987
websites at about one hundred and seventy-eight
organisations, including IKEA, according to Report URI and

68
00:04:28,987 --> 00:04:30,575
security researcher Scott Helme.

69
00:04:30,575 --> 00:04:32,891
Omni reported that account.

70
00:04:32,891 --> 00:04:37,768
The code swapped cryptocurrency wallet addresses and skimmed
payment cards, among other things.

71
00:04:37,768 --> 00:04:43,648
Report URI said about seven thousand and forty dollars had
reached the attackers' wallets by nineteen twenty-five UTC

72
00:04:43,648 --> 00:04:44,100
that day.

73
00:04:44,650 --> 00:04:50,549
K33 has entered a conditional agreement with Reverion
Capital worth thirteen million Swedish kronor, Kaupr

74
00:04:50,549 --> 00:04:52,386
reports, citing a company notice.

75
00:04:52,386 --> 00:04:57,781
If it is completed, about twenty-six thousand K33
shareholders would receive Reverion shares worth five

76
00:04:57,781 --> 00:05:03,595
million kronor as a dividend in kind, and Reverion would
issue an eight million kronor convertible loan to K33.

77
00:05:03,595 --> 00:05:08,960
The deal needs approval at an extraordinary general meeting,
and either party may end it if the conditions are not met by

78
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:11,043
the thirty-first of December twenty twenty-six.

79
00:05:13,198 --> 00:05:18,876
Lunar is selling its active crypto customer portfolio to the
Danish platform Pluto dot markets, the bank said in a press

80
00:05:18,876 --> 00:05:20,626
release on the sixteenth of November.

81
00:05:20,626 --> 00:05:25,175
According to Børsen, Lunar is shutting down its crypto
business, Lunar Block.

82
00:05:25,175 --> 00:05:30,309
Customers who hold crypto are to be transferred on the
seventeenth of December twenty twenty-six.

83
00:05:32,458 --> 00:05:37,645
The foreign ministers of Finland, Denmark, Estonia, France
and Lithuania are asking the European Union for stronger

84
00:05:37,645 --> 00:05:42,832
action against the use of crypto-assets to evade Russia
sanctions, the Finnish Ministry for Foreign Affairs said on

85
00:05:42,832 --> 00:05:44,005
the sixteenth of November.

86
00:05:44,005 --> 00:05:49,965
They want the EU to target crypto networks that help sustain
Russia's war economy, tighten enforcement, and close

87
00:05:49,965 --> 00:05:50,808
regulatory gaps.

88
00:05:50,808 --> 00:05:53,636
The letter itself has not been published in full.

89
00:05:53,636 --> 00:05:56,433
Salkunrakentaja reported the ministry.

90
00:05:58,582 --> 00:06:03,602
The Icelandic hosting company nineteen eighty-four
temporarily shut down all of its services after a serious

91
00:06:03,602 --> 00:06:06,297
cyber attack, Vísir reported on the twentieth of November.

92
00:06:06,297 --> 00:06:11,432
The company said the systems were closed deliberately to
stop the attack, and that it does not know whether any data

93
00:06:11,432 --> 00:06:11,963
were stolen.

94
00:06:11,963 --> 00:06:18,162
Wagyu, the issuer of the XMR1 token, claims that an issuing
key stored on a deleted server there was leaked.

95
00:06:18,162 --> 00:06:20,324
That claim is unconfirmed.

96
00:06:20,874 --> 00:06:23,272
That's all for issue number eight.

97
00:06:23,272 --> 00:06:25,761
Every story is at nordiccrypto.no.

98
00:06:25,761 --> 00:06:28,210
Nothing here is investment advice.

99
00:06:29,896 --> 00:06:30,838
I'm Anders Fjell.

100
00:06:30,928 --> 00:06:31,748
See you next week.

